// Sample of: gh issue list --repo <OWNER/REPO> --state open --limit 50
//            --json number,title,state,author,labels,updatedAt,url,comments
// Shape notes (Phase 8 re-verifies each): `state` arrives UPPERCASE ("OPEN"); `author` is a bare
// `{ "login": ... }` object or null (deleted/ghost accounts); `labels` is an array of label objects —
// gh includes id/color/description, only `name` is consumed — or null; `comments` is an array of
// comment objects (live-verified shape; only its length is consumed, never the entries), with the
// plain numeric count kept alongside for forward/backward tolerance; `updatedAt` is RFC 3339.
// Rows: multi-label, empty labels, null author, numeric comments (6 and 0), array comments ([] and 2 entries).
